# WeChat DevTools writes this the moment it first opens the mini program. It
# holds per-developer state -- which page was open, whether the simulator is
# docked, the last compile options -- so committing it means every machine that
# imports the project shows up as a dirty tree.
miniprogram/project.private.config.json
